{"name":"-33-9-1First","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreen","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"55","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Room","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Meanwhile, at the Griffin echelons' location."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Kord","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_connect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Kord","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This is Recon Squad B. We have crossed the kill zone to assist you in battle. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The power supply hub has been destroyed, so we can now enter the city center. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Also, a minor earthquake has been detected over here. The defense system may extend much deeper than we thought. There is also a possibility of running into turrets that are still functional. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The interference has become more severe, so we'll provide comms support through the Zener Protocol and try to keep the channel clear."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}},{"prefab":"Kord","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Copy that. Please keep in touch and eliminate any threat you encounter.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Everyone, we're splitting up here to destroy our respective targets.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Kord","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_disconnect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Kord","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(Sighs) I was prepared for it, but she really is a cold one... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I hope I didn't offend her."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Kord","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Beep...beep...beep... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The alarm sounds."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Kord","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kord","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Whoa... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"There's no end to these things. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Right, now that the signal tower is ready, I should get back to my cleanup duty."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Kord","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Kord turns off the safety of her weapon coolly and confronts the ELIDs that are swarming towards her."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Kord","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_weapon_reload","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"Kord","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Don't even think about it, infected children."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"197","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"One minute and thirty seconds later, outside the entrance of Tallinn City Station."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Sneak","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Phew, I finally made... Oh! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"What's that charging towards me?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏"}],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M4, I got to the entrance! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Ohhhh, RO is also here!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635